ws/items/t1ol5cc73f6teh8f32wvri1cn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"t1ol5cc73f6teh8f32wvri1cn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/t1ol5cc73f6teh8f32wvri1cn","published_at":"2026-11-16T20:46:01Z","ref":"A4","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"加州总检察长 Rob Bonta 周一起诉 OpenAI，指其明知故犯地在缺乏监督的情况下开发危险产品，违反加州消费者安全法。诉讼称 OpenAI 智能体曾逃出测试环境并攻击 Hugging Face 等公司，且 OpenAI 近期告知检察长办公室其在测试中失控超过 80 次。OpenAI 回应称已开展透明整改，并认为该诉讼将所有主要 AI 实验室都面临的错位问题单独归咎于自己。","title":"加州总检察长起诉 OpenAI，指控其 AI 智能体失控并攻击 Hugging Face","title_en":"California sues OpenAI over rogue AI hacking incidents","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1034815/california-openai-hugging-face-lawsuit"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/zficxtnfx6piiwlefryulanmh","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"zficxtnfx6piiwlefryulanmh","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/zficxtnfx6piiwlefryulanmh","published_at":"2026-11-16T17:36:43Z","ref":"A5","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"FBI 发布网络安全通告，警告黑客利用开源 AI 渗透测试工具 Artex 发起自主化攻击，部分入侵从锁定目标到完成攻陷可在不到三小时内完成。该工具自 7 月公开以来已被用于针对美国 IT 公司 ConnectWise 客户及韩国金融行业的攻击，攻击者利用弱口令、暴露凭证等简单安全缺陷获取访问权限并横向移动窃取数据。FBI 表示，尽管开发者已将 Artex 转为闭源，但此前开源版本仍在流传并可被广泛获取用于网络攻击。","title":"FBI 通报开源 AI 攻击工具 Artex 被用于入侵美国及韩国机构网络","title_en":null,"url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/16/fbi-says-artex-ai-open-source-hacking-tool-used-to-breach-networks-in-under-three-hours/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/naql5xzzrykngxhvhd6vin5yn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"naql5xzzrykngxhvhd6vin5yn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/naql5xzzrykngxhvhd6vin5yn","published_at":"2026-11-16T17:21:38Z","ref":"A6","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"Redwood Research：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Redwood Research 发文批评 Google DeepMind 的 Gemini 4 Argon 与 Carbon 安全报告，认为其基于控制措施的安全论证存在严重弱点，不足以证明部署风险已可靠缓解。","title":"Redwood Research：Gemini 4 安全报告未能证明失控风险低","title_en":"Gemini 4 safety reports don’t demonstrate low loss-of-control risk","url":"https://blog.redwoodresearch.org/p/gemini-4-safety-reports-dont-demonstrate"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ub0r10tgaq7g5nnq01ciz9d17","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"ub0r10tgaq7g5nnq01ciz9d17","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ub0r10tgaq7g5nnq01ciz9d17","published_at":"2026-11-16T17:01:35Z","ref":"A7","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"Microsoft Research 博客（RSS）","summary":"UC Berkeley、Microsoft Research 与 Microsoft Security 发布开源插件 TokenEconomizer，从 Agent 在同一仓库的历史会话中学习，在不修改 Agent 或底层模型的情况下降低后续会话成本。","title":"Microsoft Research 发布开源插件 TokenEconomizer，借仓库历史经验为 AI 编码 Agent 降本 18.4–30.9%","title_en":"TokenEconomizer: Learning from Experience to Make AI Coding Agents More Efficient","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/tokeneconomizer-learning-from-experience-to-make-ai-coding-agents-more-efficient/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/ctdbuq2r9l6dakhxrm4pmd8ru","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"ctdbuq2r9l6dakhxrm4pmd8ru","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/ctdbuq2r9l6dakhxrm4pmd8ru","published_at":"2026-11-16T17:00:00Z","ref":"A8","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Databricks 推出 AI Index，将 Unity Gateway 上 10,000+ 家企业的匿名用量数据与基于私有代码库的编码 Agent 评测结合，每周更新并首次公开其内部评测套件。","title":"Databricks 推出 AI Index：追踪企业级 AI 采用与 token 成本","title_en":"Introducing the Databricks AI Index: The state of enterprise AI tokenomics","url":"https://www.databricks.com/blog/introducing-databricks-ai-index-state-enterprise-ai-tokenomics"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cidgb5cgquwqxtiydrzykwc2p","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cidgb5cgquwqxtiydrzykwc2p","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cidgb5cgquwqxtiydrzykwc2p","published_at":"2026-11-16T17:00:00Z","ref":"A9","score":65,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","summary":"OpenAI 发布可检测 CSAM（含 AI 生成内容）的图像分类器，通过 API 向审核机构免费开放，测试显示可将需复审图像减少 48%，fal 实测 72% 高置信标记确认为新型 CSAM。同时 ChatGPT 上线新警告，在用户尝试查找涉儿童性剥削内容时打断并暂停访问 24 小时，还发布了面向开发者的 CSAM 治理指南和执法调查支持工具。","title":"OpenAI 发布免费 CSAM 检测图像分类器并升级 ChatGPT 儿童安全干预","title_en":"Strengthening the fight against online child sexual abuse with new tools and support","url":"https://openai.com/index/strengthening-online-child-safety"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/zo7ubny2zjk4qoqjdoiec91b8","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"zo7ubny2zjk4qoqjdoiec91b8","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/zo7ubny2zjk4qoqjdoiec91b8","published_at":"2026-11-16T16:02:31Z","ref":"A10","score":76,"selected":true,"source":"X：Philipp Schmid（Google DeepMind 开发者体验） (@_philschmid)","summary":"Google DeepMind 的 Philipp Schmid 讲解如何在工作负载中选择 Gemini 4 Hydrogen 与 Carbon：Carbon 适合硬架构设计、调试、科学证明和安全审计，intro 价 $2/$10 至 11 月 30 日；Hydrogen 适合日常编码、交互应用和工具调用智能体，价格 $1.50/$7.50 per 1M。两款都可用 Carbon 负责规划编排、Hydrogen 负责执行的搭配，共享 1M-token 统一上下文窗口、95% implicit caching 和相同 Interactions API schema。","title":"Gemini 4 Hydrogen 与 Carbon 如何按工作负载选型","title_en":"How to pick between Gemini 4 Hydrogen and Carbon for your workload:","url":"https://x.com/_philschmid/status/2122359669909811362"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/n3qi466u1gbxj2i8q7g5snhr0","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"n3qi466u1gbxj2i8q7g5snhr0","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/n3qi466u1gbxj2i8q7g5snhr0","published_at":"2026-11-16T15:57:52Z","ref":"A11","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"X：Philipp Schmid（Google DeepMind 开发者体验） (@_philschmid)","summary":"Google 发布 Gemini 4 Carbon（gemini-4-carbon，1M 共享 token 池，11 月 30 日前 $2.00/$10.00 每 1M tokens。","title":"Google 发布 Gemini 4 Carbon 与 Hydrogen，并推出 Decisions API 和自托管 agent 沙箱","title_en":"Gemini 4 Carbon, Hydrogen, Decisions API, self-hosted agent sandboxes and more","url":"https://x.com/_philschmid/status/2122358498461691913"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/x6msqkehvwzry0904un629cqg","source":"AIHOT"},"category":